# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local (AGENTS.md §4).

# ElevenLabs Agents — the voice advisor on /plan.
#
# This is an agent ID, not an API key, and it is deliberately NEXT_PUBLIC_:
# a PUBLIC agent is connected to straight from the browser with no secret, so
# the app needs no server route and no key of ours ever reaches the client.
#
# Create the agent at https://elevenlabs.io/app/agents, then configure three
# client tools on it, each marked as BLOCKING so the agent waits for the result
# before it carries on speaking. The names and parameters must match
# components/voice/useAdvisorTools.ts exactly:
#
#   relocate_for_footfall(target: string)  — find a shop/piece a better spot
#   describe_plan()                        — read out the current metrics
#   list_placements()                      — name what is on the map
#
# Also enable `agent_chat_response_part` in the agent's client_events if you
# want the subtitle to stream rather than appear a sentence at a time.
#
# If you make the agent PRIVATE instead, this will not be enough: a private
# agent needs a signed URL minted server-side from a secret API key, which means
# adding a route and an ELEVENLABS_API_KEY here — do not put an API key in a
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ELEVENLABS_AGENT_ID=
